>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><ul><li><a href=\"#/quest/realm-of-dreams-quest\">Realm of Dreams Quest</a></li></ul></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Updates%2F9.60\">9.60</a><br/>July 11, 2012<br/>Summer Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p>This area can be accessed during the <a href=\"#/quest/realm-of-dreams-quest\">Realm of Dreams Quest</a>. It consists of a <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32821,31504,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">small island (32821, 31504, 7)</a> between <a href=\"#/wiki/Vengoth\">Vengoth</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Mistrock\">Mistrock</a> with an underground system. North-east of the island there is a house with someone sleeping on a bed. To the north-east there is a portal which teleports visitors to where they came from.\n</p><p>There are no <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">creatures</a> or NPCs in the Realm of Dreams.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"1f071ad734083cee